==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Portrait''' is an Ability that first appeared as a [[Pokémon Power (TCG)|Poké-Power]] on {{TCG ID|Undaunted|Smeargle|8}} from the {{TCG|Undaunted}} expansion.
*'''Tail Whap''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Wooper|66}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

